      <div class="feature flip">
        <div class="copy-col">
          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="f4t">Built for portability</h3>
          <p data-i18n="f4">
            Watching consultants at work made one thing obvious: laptops don’t fit a job that happens on the road
            and between farms, often with no signal. I proposed mobile-first, offline-capable screens that sync on
            their own once the connection returns. The client wasn’t ready to invest in it then, but the idea
            never left me.
          </p>
