    <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="c-outcome">
      <h2 class="t-h4" id="c-outcome" data-i18n="ouTitle">04 · Outcome</h2>
      <div class="chapter-body pair">
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="ou1t">Then vs Now</h3>
          <p data-i18n="ou1">
            Back in 2022 I designed the client dashboard and the Web Manager home end to end, and built PAP and
            the satellite mapping legend with another intern. The mobile-first proposal didn’t move forward then.
            But I just couldn’t resist. In 2026 I picked this project up and redesigned most of the screens I had,
            this time with the experience I’d acquired. I also took into my hands the opportunity to finally bring
            into existence my vision for the mobile versions that could not be done back then.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="ou2t">What I’d test next</h3>
          <p data-i18n="ou2">
            None of these screens have been tested with users yet, and realistically they may never be. Still, if
            I ever got the chance, I’d put the mobile PAP in the hands of consultants on their routes and watch
            whether they reach the current step of the crop cycle faster than on a laptop. I’d also love to hear,
            in their own words, whether pins and quick edits earn a place in their day, or whether they’d still
            rather keep their good ol’ notebooks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
